stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Applicant
    Applicant --> Hired: offer accepted
    Hired --> Onboarding: DOJ or Day 1
    Onboarding --> Confirmed: probation cleared
    Confirmed --> Confirmed: transfer, promotion or revision
    Confirmed --> Resigned: notice served
    Resigned --> FnF: last working day
    FnF --> Alumni: dues settled
    Alumni --> [*]
    Alumni --> Hired: rehire

    note right of Applicant
        No statutory obligation yet.
        Collect PAN and any prior UAN.
        Bank details only after written
        SPDI consent is recorded.
        Aadhaar optional, token store only.
    end note

    note right of Hired
        Employee generates or links UAN
        via UMANG face authentication,
        employer tracks and chases.
        ESI IP registration if covered wage
        at a covered establishment.
        Form 124 ex-12BB and regime election.
        Appointment letter in the state form
        where the establishment has 10 plus workers.
    end note

    note right of Onboarding
        EPF and EDLI contributions begin
        from the first wage month, and EPS
        only where the member is eligible.
        PT deduction per state slab.
        LWF deduction where the state levies it.
        Employee Register entry, Form I or state form.
    end note

    note right of Confirmed
        Monthly ECR and ESI contribution.
        PT return at the frequency the state sets.
        Quarterly TDS return Form 138 ex-24Q.
        Gratuity accrues on continuous service.
        A revision triggers PF and TDS recompute
        as a diff, never an overwrite.
    end note

    note right of Resigned
        Date of exit marked on the EPFO portal,
        not in the ECR file.
        Contributions stop at the date of leaving.
        Notice-pay TDS adjustment.
    end note

    note right of FnF
        Gratuity after 5 years of continuous
        service by the day count, or pro rata
        on death, disablement or fixed-term expiry.
        Leave encashment, final TDS true-up.
        Form 130 ex-Form 16 comes from TRACES
        after the Tax Year, fenced until Q4.
    end note

    note right of Alumni
        UAN stays with the member.
        Registers kept five years from last entry.
        Other classes per the counsel schedule.
        Template erasure confirmed per device.
    end note
